            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I have tried to fix by upgrading python, however it seems to be a regression on mypy side. Here is an issue: https://github.com/python/mypy/issues/21136. It seems to be there was a regression in their code in version 1.20.2, but the code does not seems to be specific for python version. I have updated the python version and added instruction to skip mypy 1.20.2, so when there will be a new version, we will use it.",
